  "implementation": [
    "Remote terminal launch omits unsupported CLI sandbox/approval flags. The relay narrows only the reviewed 0.167 null-settings resume envelope into the exact saved UUID, directory, read-only sandbox and on-request approval policy. Every non-null override, expanded field, foreign target and replay refuses.",
    "Project config/read is limited to the selected directory, validates all effective restrictions and brackets delivery with original-account reads. The retained Windows logical channel has the same project boundary.",
    "The exact first model/list page and parameter-free configRequirements/read are account-bracketed metadata requests. Retained channels admit them only for native 0.167. Expanded queries, malformed metadata and account changes refuse.",
    "Eleven observed optional feature/catalog methods receive local method-not-found errors. They never reach the native provider, enumerate unrelated tasks, install anything or grant additional capabilities. Unknown methods and task/config/account effects still close the attachment."
  ],
